  "ruleText": "Env-Or 604.04 Discharges of Hazardous Waste. Any person required to report under RSA 147-A:11 shall notify the department in accordance with RSA 147-A and Env-Hw 100 - 1400.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Or 600) #8812, eff 2-1-07; ss by #10831, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14419, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
